[h1]R.A.T.S. Sensor Views 0.4.3 – steer it by ear[/h1]
[i]R.A.T.S. - Reconnaissance, Acoustics, Terrain & Signals[/i]

Wire-guided fish, the game's track display off, just you and the waterfall.

[h2][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3833019654]R.A.T.S. Sensor Views 0.4.3[/url][/h2]
[list]
[*]Your own torpedoes now show on the sonar display – only when your sonar would really hear them
[*]Watch the trace curve off the bow and steer the wire onto the target
[*]A depth strip you can actually read: your boat, the torpedo, the layer and every contact on its own line
[/list]
[b]Fighter jocks, you're covered too[/b]
[list]
[*]F-4 and F-15 scopes no longer say "SEARCH RADAR OFF" with the radar on
[*]The radar arc sits in front of the jet, not behind it
[/list]
[b]Smaller stuff[/b]
[list]
[*]Ready for the latest game update
[*]Select your torpedo and the sonar stays on your sub instead of jumping to the airbase
[/list]

[i]R.A.T.S. - Ratte's Assorted Tactical Systems[/i]
